<Base locale="zh" title="页面未找到 / Page not found" kind="404" noindex><section class="shell not-found"><span class="eyebrow">404 / PAGE NOT FOUND</span><h1>页面未找到</h1><p>链接可能已更新，请从首页重新浏览。<br/><span lang="en">This link may have changed. Please continue from the homepage.</span></p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="/">返回首页<Icon/></a><a class="button button-text" href="/en/" lang="en">English home<Icon/></a></div></section></Base>
